Shared lesson — the other skater can't make it — to the family who stays, when the other skater leaves before the
  notice period: keep it as a private lesson at the full price, or cancel with no charge, and the answer-by time
  ~~(the start of the notice period)~~. Always sent. (ADR-026, amended 2026-10-13)
  *Changed 2026-10-13 (ADR-031 decision 8): the answer-by time is whichever comes first, the start of the notice
  period or 7 days after the other skater left.*
Shared lesson cancelled, no answer — to the family who stays, when they didn't answer by ~~the start of the notice
